      "writtenOn": "2025-04-30T23:06:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, I did the sign encoding thing like you suggested. I feel like we can do this optimization (i.e. allow subset draws with clamp tiling) for the regular HW image shader too, maybe in a follow-up?",
